{1}{[Before you stands an old man in his late fifties, he greets you with a warm smile.] Hello, you must be @PCNAME@, the new young detective we've been expecting. A pleasure to meet you. I am Lord Davidian. I was asked by Chief Shards to help guide you...}{[Before you stands an old man in his late fifties, he greets you with a warm smile.] Hello, you must be @PCNAME@, the new young detective we've been expecting. A pleasure to meet you. I am Lord Davidian. I was asked by Chief Shards to help guide you...}{}{}{}{}
{2}{Cheef Shurdz a meenie. He call me dumb. *sniff*}{}{-4}{}{111}{}
{3}{Lord. Dat fun-e ferst name ta haf.}{}{-4}{}{161}{}
{4}{Chief Shards... He gives me the creeps with all that yelling and stuff.}{}{5}{}{21}{}
{5}{Hmpf! Chief Shards! No matter what I do, he's shouting at me. All the time. Damn buffle-headed piker.}{}{5}{}{41}{}

{21}{Yes, well he does take some getting used to, but he has done much for this department. There is indeed a great many lessons to be learned from him.}{Yes, well he does take some getting used to, but he has done much for this department. There is indeed a great many lessons to be learned from him.}{}{}{}{}
{22}{I shall endeavour to learn all I can from both you and Chief Shards.}{}{5}{}{321}{}
{23}{*sigh* Very well, let us just move along with the task at hand shall we?}{}{5}{}{341}{}

{41}{Young man! You needn't be so critical of YOUR BOSS! Take that tone with me and you'll find yourself walking all the Olde Town Square night shift beats!}{Young lady! You needn't be so critical of YOUR BOSS! Take that tone with me and you'll find yourself walking all the Olde Town Square night shift beats!}{}{}{}{}
{42}{Okay, okay, I'm sorry. Let's get to my first assignment already.}{}{5}{}{61}{}

{61}{[He hands you the latest issue of Nodnol Times.] Read this. Jack is the man we're after...excuse me, the man we HAVE BEEN after for a year now. This is the most baffling case our department, or any law enforcement agency for that matter, has ever come across.}{[He hands you the latest issue of Nodnol Times.] Read this. Jack is the man we're after...excuse me, the man we HAVE BEEN... after for a year now. This is the most baffling case our department, or any law enforcement agency for that matter, has ever come across.}{}{}{}{in -5402}
{62}{Why is that?}{}{5}{}{81}{}
{63}{Why dat be?}{}{-4}{}{81}{}

{81}{Jack, or Jack the Riddler as he is commonly known, is a serial killer of the most devious, maniacal and hellish variety. He kills with a precision and thoroughness that leaves little room for remorse... [he pauses briefly to collect himself.]}{Jack, or Jack the Riddler as he is commonly known, is a serial killer of the most devious, maniacal and hellish variety. He kills with a precision and thoroughness that leaves little room for remorse... [he pauses briefly to collect himself.]}{}{}{}{}
{82}{Dreadful. Please, continue.}{}{5}{}{101}{}
{83}{Dat sound bad. Tell more plees.}{}{-4}{}{101}{}

{101}{Forgive me. I fear the length and breadth of this ungodly case has taken it's toll. [He suddenly stiffens and his face is free of emotion] Your first task is a simple, but most neccessary one. You are to go to Lady Mi's at 14 Kensington Way and find out what you can from her regarding those ladies previously in her employ who fell victim to "Jack". Upon completion, you are to come back to me and give a full report.}{Forgive me. I fear the length and breadth of this ungodly case has taken it's toll. [He suddenly stiffens and his face is free of emotion] Your first task is a simple, but most neccessary one. You are to go to Lady Mi's at 14 Kensington Way and find out what you can from her regarding those ladies previously in her employ who fell victim to "Jack". Upon completion, you are to come back to me and give a full report.}{}{}{}{ru 2003,qu1002 2}
{102}{Very well. I shall return post-haste.}{}{5}{}{361}{}
{103}{Duh...o-tay.}{}{-4}{}{361}{}

{111}{Well, he has a low tolerance for.. uh.. how should I put this.. low IQ. Don't worry, you don't get to talk to him much, as I'll be guiding you here.}{Well, he has a low tolerance for.. uh.. how should I put this.. low IQ. Don't worry, you don't get to talk to him much, as I'll be guiding you here.}{}{}{}{}
{112}{Okee. Me get it. What I do now?}{}{-4}{}{61}{}

{121}{Hello again. What brings you back around?}{Hello again. What brings you back around?}{}{}{}{}
