{124}{Uh, this is kinda embarrassing, but I said something wrong and Lady Mi won't talk to me anymore..}{}{5}{qu1002 6}{221}{}
{125}{Uh.. Me piss off ladee Mi, she no talk to me no more.}{}{-4}{qu1002 6}{221}{}
{126}{Nothing, I just decided to drop by..}{}{5}{}{}{fl 141}
