{141}{OK, bye then.}{OK, bye then.}{}{}{}{}

{161}{Yes, well...you may call me Davidian... or just D, if it makes you more...comfortable, chap.}{Yes, well...you may call me Davidian ... or just D, if it makes you more...comfortable, miss.}{}{}{}{}
