{181}{Good luck on your first assignment, @PCNAME@.}{Good luck on your first assignment, @PCNAME@.}{}{}{}{}
{182}{Hey! Don't you dare talk to me like that!}{Hey! Don't you dare talk to me like that!}{}{}{}{}
