{221}{Uh-oh. That sounds bad. Didn't I tell you not to be rude to her? Looks like we're not going to get any futher with our investigations. I suggest you reload the game and try again.}{Uh-oh. That sounds bad. Didn't I tell you not to be rude to her? Looks like we're not going to get any futher with our investigations. I suggest you reload the game and try again.}{}{}{}{}
{222}{Oh, sorry, I simply forgot. There was another option that didn't sound as insulting..I'll try that..}{}{5}{}{}{}
