{281}{Yes, very nicely done, @PCNAME@. This new information will surely come in handy. 'Tis a beautiful day. Take a walk about town and get acquainted with your surroundings. I'll send someone for you when you are needed further.}{Yes, very nicely done, @PCNAME@. This new information will surely come in handy. 'Tis a beautiful day. Take a walk about town and get acquainted with your surroundings. I'll send someone for you when you are needed further.}{}{}{}{qu 1002 4, ru 2005}
